{"seq":3,"slug":"electromagnetic-spectrum","title":"高中物理进阶 — 电磁波谱与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/physics-advanced/advanced-em/electromagnetic-spectrum","wordCount":2135,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高中物理进阶-电磁波谱与应用\">高中物理进阶 — 电磁波谱与应用</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>电磁波谱涵盖从极低频无线电波到超高能γ射线的全部电磁辐射，它们本质上都是以光速传播的横波，区别仅在于频率（或波长）不同。理解电磁波谱是连接电磁学理论与现代科技应用的关键桥梁。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电磁波的基本性质</strong>：横波、光速传播（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\lambda f = 3 \\times 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m/s）、不需要介质</li>\n<li><strong>电磁波谱分区</strong>：无线电波、微波、红外线、可见光、紫外线、X 射线、γ 射线</li>\n<li><strong>波粒二象性</strong>：电磁波既有波动性（干涉、衍射）也有粒子性（光电效应），E = hf</li>\n<li><strong>黑体辐射</strong>：任何温度高于绝对零度的物体都发射电磁辐射，辐射谱与温度相关</li>\n<li><strong>电磁波的产生</strong>：加速运动的电荷辐射电磁波，不同频段有不同的产生机制</li>\n<li><strong>大气窗口</strong>：地球大气对不同频段电磁波的透过率不同，影响天文观测和通信</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"电磁波谱的完整图景\">电磁波谱的完整图景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波段</th>\n<th>波长范围</th>\n<th>频率范围</th>\n<th>产生机制</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无线电波</td>\n<td>&gt; 1 mm</td>\n<td>&lt; 300 GHz</td>\n<td>电路中振荡电流</td>\n<td>广播、通信、雷达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微波</td>\n<td>1 mm – 1 m</td>\n<td>300 MHz – 300 GHz</td>\n<td>速调管、磁控管</td>\n<td>微波炉、5G、卫星通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红外线</td>\n<td>700 nm – 1 mm</td>\n<td>300 GHz – 430 THz</td>\n<td>分子振动和转动</td>\n<td>遥感、热成像、夜视</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见光</td>\n<td>400 – 700 nm</td>\n<td>430 – 750 THz</td>\n<td>原子外层电子跃迁</td>\n<td>照明、光纤通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紫外线</td>\n<td>10 – 400 nm</td>\n<td>750 THz – 30 PHz</td>\n<td>高温等离子体</td>\n<td>消毒、光刻、荧光检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X 射线</td>\n<td>0.01 – 10 nm</td>\n<td>30 PHz – 30 EHz</td>\n<td>内层电子跃迁、轫致辐射</td>\n<td>医学成像、晶体分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>γ 射线</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.01 nm</td>\n<td>&gt; 30 EHz</td>\n<td>原子核跃迁、粒子湮灭</td>\n<td>癌症放疗、工业探伤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电磁波谱是连续的，各波段之间没有截然的分界线，划分标准主要基于产生机制和探测方法的不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电磁波的产生与辐射\">电磁波的产生与辐射</h3><p>一切加速运动的电荷都会辐射电磁波，这是电磁波产生的根本机制。辐射功率与电荷加速度的平方成正比（拉莫尔公式）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\frac{q^2a^2}{6\\pi\\varepsilon_0 c^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3271em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同频段的电磁波对应不同的物理过程：</p>\n<p><strong>无线电波与微波</strong>：通过电子线路中的振荡电流产生。LC 振荡电路的固有频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0 = 1/(2\\pi\\sqrt{LC})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定了辐射频率。天线将电路中的电磁振荡转化为向外传播的电磁波。</p>\n<p><strong>红外线</strong>：主要由分子的振动和转动运动产生。任何温度高于绝对零度的物体都会发射红外辐射。根据维恩位移定律，辐射峰值波长与温度成反比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.898</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> m⋅K</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = \\frac{b}{T}, \\quad b = 2.898 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{ m·K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.898</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m⋅K</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>人体温度约 310K，对应峰值辐射波长约 9.4 μm（中红外波段），这就是红外热像仪的工作原理。</p>\n<p><strong>可见光</strong>：原子外层电子在不同能级之间跃迁时辐射。每种元素的特征光谱（发射谱或吸收谱）如同&quot;指纹&quot;，是光谱分析的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>X 射线</strong>：两种产生机制——特征 X 射线（内层电子被击出后外层电子填补空位时辐射）和轫致辐射（高速电子被原子核电场减速时辐射）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"波粒二象性\">波粒二象性</h3><p>电磁辐射既表现出波动性，也表现出粒子性。低频长波长时波动性显著（如无线电波的衍射），高频短波长时粒子性显著（如γ射线的光电效应）。</p>\n<p><strong>波动性证据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>杨氏双缝干涉：相干光通过双缝后形成明暗交替的干涉条纹</li>\n<li>单缝衍射：光通过窄缝后偏离直线传播</li>\n<li>偏振：横波特有现象，偏振片可以选择特定振动方向</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>粒子性证据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光电效应：光照射金属表面释放电子，爱因斯坦解释为光量子（光子）E = hf</li>\n<li>康普顿效应：X 射线被电子散射后波长增大，证明光子具有动量 p = h/λ</li>\n<li>黑体辐射：普朗克假说 E = nhf 解决了&quot;紫外灾难&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>光子能量与频率的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = hf = \\frac{hc}{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.626</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 6.626 \\times 10^{-34}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.626</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">34</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> J·s 为普朗克常数。可见光光子能量约 1.8-3.1 eV，X 射线光子能量可达 keV 到 MeV 量级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电磁波与物质的相互作用\">电磁波与物质的相互作用</h3><p>电磁波与物质的相互作用方式取决于波长：</p>\n<p><strong>反射与折射</strong>：所有频段都遵循反射定律和折射定律（斯涅尔定律）。不同介质对不同波长的折射率不同（色散），这是棱镜分光和彩虹形成的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>吸收</strong>：物质选择性地吸收特定频率的电磁波。臭氧层吸收紫外线保护地表生物，水蒸气和二氧化碳吸收红外线产生温室效应。</p>\n<p><strong>散射</strong>：瑞利散射强度与波长的四次方成反比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto 1/\\lambda^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），蓝光散射远强于红光，这解释了天空为蓝色、日出日落为红色的现象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现代通信中的电磁波应用\">现代通信中的电磁波应用</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>波长</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AM 广播</td>\n<td>535-1605 kHz</td>\n<td>~200 m</td>\n<td>电离层反射，覆盖远</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FM 广播</td>\n<td>88-108 MHz</td>\n<td>~3 m</td>\n<td>视距传播，音质好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WiFi 5</td>\n<td>5 GHz</td>\n<td>6 cm</td>\n<td>高带宽，穿墙弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5G mmWave</td>\n<td>24-47 GHz</td>\n<td>~8 mm</td>\n<td>超高速，覆盖短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光纤通信</td>\n<td>~193 THz</td>\n<td>1550 nm</td>\n<td>超大容量，低损耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>频率越高，可承载的信息量越大（香农定理），但传播损耗也越大、穿透能力越弱。这是通信系统设计中频率选择的基本权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>波长计算</strong>：中国移动 5G 使用的 n41 频段中心频率为 2.6 GHz，计算对应的电磁波波长。这个波长与哪些日常物体的尺度相当？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>维恩定律应用</strong>：太阳表面温度约 5778K，求其辐射峰值波长。该波长属于电磁波谱的哪个区域？这与太阳光看起来是白色有什么关系？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>光子能量</strong>：计算波长为 550nm（绿光）的光子能量（以 eV 为单位）。要使功函数为 2.3 eV 的钠金属产生光电效应，所需光的最长波长是多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>瑞利散射</strong>：已知蓝光（450nm）的瑞利散射强度是红光（700nm）的多少倍？用此解释为什么高海拔地区天空看起来更深蓝。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>综合分析</strong>：为什么医学上用 X 射线而不是可见光来进行人体内部成像？从电磁波与物质相互作用的角度分析。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>电磁波谱的发现历史跨越两个多世纪。1800年赫歇尔发现红外线，1801年里特发现紫外线，1895年伦琴发现 X 射线，每一次新波段的发现都开启了科学和技术的新纪元。</p>\n<p>现代天文学的多信使观测革命正在改变我们认识宇宙的方式。射电望远镜（如中国 FAST）、红外空间望远镜（如韦伯太空望远镜）、X 射线卫星、γ 射线卫星，每个波段都揭示了宇宙不同面貌。2017年引力波和电磁波的联合观测更标志着多信使天文学时代的到来。</p>\n<p>竞赛拓展：电磁波的多普勒效应不同于声波多普勒效应，它没有介质参考系的限制。相对论多普勒公式为 f&#39; = f√((1+β)/(1-β))（β = v/c），红移现象是宇宙膨胀的关键证据。在自主招生中可能出现相对论多普勒效应的定量计算题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电磁波谱从无线电波到γ射线构成连续谱，本质是同一种物理现象</li>\n<li>加速电荷是电磁波辐射的根本来源，不同频段对应不同的物理过程</li>\n<li>波粒二象性是电磁辐射的基本属性，E = hf 联系了波动性和粒子性</li>\n<li>电磁波与物质的相互作用（反射、折射、吸收、散射）取决于波长</li>\n<li>通信系统中频率选择是信息容量与传播特性之间的权衡</li>\n<li>多波段观测是现代天文学和遥感技术的核心方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高中物理进阶 — 电磁波谱与应用","id":"高中物理进阶-电磁波谱与应用"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"电磁波谱的完整图景","id":"电磁波谱的完整图景"},{"level":3,"text":"电磁波的产生与辐射","id":"电磁波的产生与辐射"},{"level":3,"text":"波粒二象性","id":"波粒二象性"},{"level":3,"text":"电磁波与物质的相互作用","id":"电磁波与物质的相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"现代通信中的电磁波应用","id":"现代通信中的电磁波应用"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高中物理进阶 — 交流电路分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/physics-advanced/advanced-em/ac-circuits"},"next":{"title":"理科方向 物理进阶 — 量子物理深入","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/physics-advanced/modern-physics-adv/quantum-physics"}}